Package: emc2101-dkms
Version: @DEBVERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Damjan Marion <damjan.marion@gmail.com>
Depends: dkms, udev
Recommends: linux-headers
Description: Microchip EMC2101 fan controller hwmon driver (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree build of the Linux hwmon driver for the Microchip EMC2101
 SMBus PWM fan controller with internal and external temperature sensors.
 .
 For a Raspberry Pi 5 / CM5 with the EMC2101 at 0x4C on the 40-pin header
 I2C1 (GPIO2/3), this package also installs and enables two device tree
 overlays in /boot/firmware/config.txt: one lengthening the RP1 I2C1 SDA
 hold time to the 300 ns SMBus minimum, and one declaring the EMC2101.
 A udev rule applies the PWM frequency, fan curve and diode type from
 /etc/default/emc2101 whenever the device appears.
 .
 Source is taken unmodified from the upstream patch series
 "[PATCH v3 3/3] drivers: hwmon: add EMC2101 driver" by
 Álvaro Fernández Rojas (2025-07-09), which is not yet merged into
 mainline Linux.
